Toolchain
=========

System GCC cross-compiler for AArch64 is required:

    sudo apt install gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu

The Makefile uses CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu- (GCC 11.4.0, glibc),
which is the default system toolchain on Ubuntu 22.04.

Build
=====

For each model, copy the corresponding config and run make:

    cp -f config-<MODEL> .config
    make

Output: u-boot_nand.img

Models
======

MT7981 (Filogic 820):

  TUF-AX4200         cp -f config-TUF-AX4200 .config
  TUF-AX6000         cp -f config-TUF-AX6000 .config
  RT-AX59U           cp -f config-RT-AX59U .config
  RT-AX57M           cp -f config-RT-AX57M .config
  RT-8103AX          cp -f config-RT-8103AX .config
  RT-AX52            cp -f config-RT-AX52 .config
  PRT-AX57_GO        cp -f config-PRT-AX57_GO .config
  CHEETAH (SPIM-NAND) cp -f config-CHEETAH-spim_nand .config

MT7986A (Filogic 830):

  PANTHERA (SPIM-NAND) cp -f config-PANTHERA-spim_nand .config
  PANTHERB (SPIM-NAND) cp -f config-PANTHERB-spim_nand .config
